abstract: This is a collection of high resolution coastal carbon monitoring datasets
  (both provisional and research-ready) from instrumentation configured on shore-side
  infrastructure and oceanographic moorings in the Northeast Pacific beginning in
  2014. These data provide information on the variability of inorganic carbon conditions
  over a range of temporal scales at select coastal sites in British Columbia.
